Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/brauliobo/pg_sift

Package: postgresql-18-pg-sift
Architecture: amd64
Depends: postgresql-18, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: CTID-bitmap full-text search index with BM25 ranking for PostgreSQL
 pg_sift adds the sift index access method (CREATE INDEX ... USING sift)
 with boolean, phrase, prefix, wildcard, regex and fuzzy queries, exact BM25
 ranking, count(*) from the index and parallel index builds.
